{"unit_id":"SiriLee__dsh-approval-hotkeys#card-zh","repo":"SiriLee/dsh-approval-hotkeys","commit":"d6b16a1229a8dc23d83404e06173af067847c106","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-hotkeys 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的交互面板快捷键插件。它在浏览器文档上注册键盘监听，并通过当前主视图会话的待处理交互定位对应面板；按 Enter 会触发审批、提问或计划审查面板的确认按钮，按 Esc 会触发取消按钮。运行时状态可读时只处理对应请求，状态不可读时才回退到可见面板查找。插件会忽略输入框、组合键、输入法组字、已处理事件和禁用按钮，并在卸载时移除监听。适合希望用键盘快速处理 DSH 网页交互的用户。安装命令为 dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-approval-hotkeys，无需额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:45-52","src/client/hotkeys.ts:252-285","src/client/target.ts:88-111"]}
{"unit_id":"SiriLee__dsh-approval-hotkeys#card-en","repo":"SiriLee/dsh-approval-hotkeys","commit":"d6b16a1229a8dc23d83404e06173af067847c106","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-hotkeys adds Enter and Esc shortcuts to DSH web interaction panels. It matches pending approval, question, or plan-review requests and activates the corresponding confirm or cancel button. It ignores typing fields and composition events, and removes its listener on unload.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:45-52","src/client/hotkeys.ts:252-285","src/client/target.ts:88-111"]}
